.TH QUIPU-MERGE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-merge \- Merge a share back into ROOT, with reviewable conflict decisions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu merge\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-emit\-decisions\fR] [\fB\-\-decisions\fR] [\fB\-\-reviewer\fR] [\fB\-\-slot\-scoped\fR] [\fB\-\-propose\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIshare\-dir\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Merge a share back into ROOT, with reviewable conflict decisions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-emit\-decisions\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-decisions\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-reviewer\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-slot\-scoped\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-propose\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIshare\-dir\fR>

